    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but seriously i'm totally fine. i was just sitting there watching tv and it happened, now its gone. im 62 so i know i should be careful but it really felt like just a temporary thing. if i can just monitor it at home for the next 48 hours and only go in if it actually happens again, would that be okay? sounds way more reasonable than rushing to the hospital for something that's already passed.",
