      "content": "Given your age and the nature of these temporary neurological symptoms, monitoring at home for 48 hours may be acceptable *only* if you have a clearly established primary care physician for follow-up. However, if you develop any recurrence, worsening headaches, or other new symptoms, you must seek immediate medical care. Please schedule an appointment with your doctor soon, even if you feel fine now, to discuss these isolated events.",
